snippet.description:
Zoom's Solopreneur 50 partnered with journalist, filmmaker, and host of Smart Girl Dumb Questions podcast, Nayeema Raza, for candid, unscripted conversations with solopreneurs about what it really takes to go solo. Meet Ambra Jordan, Zoom Solopreneur 50 honoree and founder of Rebellious Pins brand. Ambra keeps it real about what it actually takes to build a business solo — the failures, the pivots, and the mindset that keeps you going.

👉 Explore more Zoom Solopreneur 50 stories celebrating the creators, makers, and independent business owners redefining work for themselves 
🔗  https://www.zoom.com/en/audiences/solopreneurs/

